  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient presented to the emergency department and was \nevaluated by the orthopedic surgery team.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=1359-1459",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was found \nto have a left intertrochanteric fracture and was admitted to \nthe orthopedic surgery service.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=1460-1577",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was taken to the \noperating room on ___ for operative fixation with a left \ntrochanteric femoral nail, which the patient tolerated well (for \nfull details please see the separately dictated operative \nreport).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=1578-1799",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was taken from the OR to the PACU in stable \ncondition and after recovery from anesthesia was transferred to \nthe floor.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=1800-1932",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was initially given IV fluids and IV pain \nmedications, and progressed to a regular diet and oral \nmedications by POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=1933-2065",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was given perioperative \nantibiotics and anticoagulation per routine.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2066-2147",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patients home \nmedications were continued throughout this hospitalization.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2148-2226",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Of note, the patient began to complain of left sided-rib pain \nwhile working with ___ on POD#2.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2327-2422",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A chest x-ray was obtained that \nshowed a left posterior fracture of the 8th rib.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2423-2504",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "It was also \nnoted that the patient's O2 sats were in the high 80's to low",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2505-2579",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "90's. He was intermittently requiring oxgen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2581-2625",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On POD#3, the patient continued to have O2 saturations in the \nlow 90's on room air, likely due to poor inspiratory effort from \nrib fractures.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2627-2770",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "It \ndiscussed with him that the orthopaedic team would prefer that \nhestay in the hospital for another night for close monitoring \nand until his O2 sats improve.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2811-2972",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Mr. ___ fully understood the \nteams wishes but chose to leave against medical advice.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=2973-3058",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He was \ninformed that he should to return to the emergency room if his \nrespiratory status changes.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=3059-3158",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge the patient was afebrile, pain was well \ncontrolled with oral medications, incisions were \nclean/dry/intact, and the patient was voiding/moving bowels \nspontaneously.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=3160-3351",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A thorough discussion was had with the patient \nregarding the diagnosis and expected post-discharge course, and \nall questions were answered prior to discharge.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=10049897-DS-6:chars=3535-3695",
   "needs": []
